  "description": "eeCLOUD is a high-performance data engine for .NET 8 built around a logical Memory model instead of a traditional ORM schema. It combines high-throughput Raw JSON persistence with batched Object Graph storage for nested models, automatic database and memory bootstrap, clustering, reference indexing, date-range queries, mixed Raw JSON/V4 compatibility, and optional eeCACHE acceleration across PostgreSQL, MySQL, SQL Server, FTP, SFTP and local cache backends. It is designed for backend systems that need flexible data structures, rapid delivery and strong runtime performance without heavy ORM configuration.",
